    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one more thing—sometimes these gates feel like they're just being bypassed or things slip through despite the checks. in your experience, what are the most common reasons for these \"unseen\" failures or why a process might fail to catch something that shouldn't have gotten through? i want to frame this for the stakeholders in terms of risk management.",
